 "description": "List a company's detected recurring subscriptions \u2014 normalized vendor, monthly cost in cents, billing cadence, next expected charge and whether the price recently rose \u2014 filtered by lifecycle status, with offset pagination and a total count.  Exposed: it reads back a company's own spend, derived from transactions its members can already see, and is membership-checked on filter.company_id. Nothing in the response is a credential, an identifier belonging to a third party, or a value the caller does not already hold. It is the read that answers \"what am I paying for every month\", and the duplicate-tool and price-increase insights point at these same streams.",
